1
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,161
Head and shoulders.

2
00:00:18,359 --> 00:00:21,169
Knees and toes, Knees and toes.

3
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:25,247
Eyes and mouth and ears and nose.

4
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,930
Ears and nose...

5
00:00:31,079 --> 00:00:32,728
Where are we?

6
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:35,123
We're in the garden.

7
00:00:35,719 --> 00:00:37,608
Your garden?

8
00:00:38,159 --> 00:00:41,720
No, silly! The palace garden.

9
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:45,931
Look!

10
00:00:46,119 --> 00:00:47,768
There's Sylvia!

11
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,961
What's she doing?

12
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:53,086
She's doing her exercises.

13
00:00:53,439 --> 00:00:56,204
Knees and nose, knees and toes...

14
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:03,927
Quick! Behind this thing!

15
00:01:04,239 --> 00:01:06,810
-What thing? -The statue.

16
00:01:08,319 --> 00:01:11,721
-Are you all right? -No, we aren't.

17
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:13,520
We're hungry.

18
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:16,001
Can we have some food, please?

19
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:19,043
Can I have a clock, please?

20
00:01:19,439 --> 00:01:20,679
A clock?

21
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:24,441
Excuse me.

22
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:26,729
Yes. A clock.

23
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,649
He likes clocks.

24
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:31,804
Somebody's coming.

25
00:01:35,599 --> 00:01:37,488
Who is it?

26
00:01:37,959 --> 00:01:39,529
I don't know.

27
00:01:39,719 --> 00:01:41,323
I can't see.

28
00:01:44,719 --> 00:01:45,844
OK!

29
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:49,290
Oh, no! It's raining.

30
00:01:50,439 --> 00:01:52,806
Look, wait over there.

31
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:56,404
-OK. -See you this evening.

32
00:01:56,879 --> 00:01:59,007
-When? -Seven o'clock.

33
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:01,646
See you at seven this evening.

34
00:02:01,959 --> 00:02:04,359
Seven o'clock. Right!

35
00:02:11,319 --> 00:02:13,719
What's the time now?

36
00:02:24,159 --> 00:02:25,888
It's eight o'clock.

37
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:31,239
Hello?

38
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:36,642
No, I'm busy. I'm having breakfast.

39
00:02:44,479 --> 00:02:46,243
It's one o'clock.

40
00:02:51,039 --> 00:02:52,164
Hello?

41
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:56,128
No, I'm busy.

42
00:02:56,599 --> 00:02:58,282
I'm having lunch.

43
00:03:05,599 --> 00:03:07,363
It's seven o'clock.

44
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,410
Hello?

45
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:15,648
No, I'm busy.

46
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,489
I'm having dinner.

47
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,764
It's nine o'clock.

48
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:25,445
Hello?

49
00:03:27,319 --> 00:03:29,242
No, I'm busy.

50
00:03:29,639 --> 00:03:31,163
I'm having a bath.

51
00:03:35,719 --> 00:03:37,767
It's ten o'clock.

52
00:03:41,879 --> 00:03:43,209
Hello?

53
00:03:44,759 --> 00:03:48,046
Busy? No, I'm going to bed.

54
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,446
Good night!

55
00:03:58,919 --> 00:04:00,683
One o'clock.

56
00:04:00,879 --> 00:04:03,040
It's lunch-time.

57
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:06,970
It's lunch-time, dear.

58
00:04:07,199 --> 00:04:08,769
I'm coming.

59
00:04:15,439 --> 00:04:18,487
It's lunch-time, Sylvia.

60
00:04:21,839 --> 00:04:23,682
I'm not very well.

61
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:26,208
Can I have lunch in my room?

62
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:29,128
What's the matter?

63
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:32,450
I've got a terrible headache.

64
00:04:47,879 --> 00:04:48,925
Headache.

65
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,723
Stomachache.

66
00:04:52,759 --> 00:04:54,363
Toothache.

67
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,331
Backache.

68
00:05:02,879 --> 00:05:04,244
Come in.

69
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,606
What's the matter?

70
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,961
I've got a headache, doctor.

71
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:10,446
A headache? Take this.

72
00:05:10,639 --> 00:05:12,209
Thank you, doctor.

73
00:05:12,759 --> 00:05:14,124
Next!

74
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:16,240
What's the matter?

75
00:05:17,079 --> 00:05:19,889
I've got stomachache, doctor.

76
00:05:20,079 --> 00:05:22,285
Stomachache? Take this.

77
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:24,209
Thank you, doctor.

78
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:25,760
Next!

79
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,280
What's the matter?

80
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:30,369
I've got toothache, doctor.

81
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:33,440
Toothache? Take this.

82
00:05:33,639 --> 00:05:35,209
Thank you, doctor.

83
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:37,006
Next!

84
00:05:38,319 --> 00:05:39,649
What's the matter?

85
00:05:39,839 --> 00:05:41,1000
I've got backache, doctor.

86
00:05:42,319 --> 00:05:44,890
Backache? Take this.

87
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:46,887
Thank you, doctor.

88
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,283
A headache?

89
00:05:55,959 --> 00:06:00,168
Stay in your room, dear, and have a rest.

90
00:06:01,639 --> 00:06:05,200
Lunch for the Princess in her room!

91
00:06:08,519 --> 00:06:10,999
Sylvia isn't very well.

92
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:13,648
She's got a headache.

93
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:30,568
She's got a headache.

94
00:06:30,879 --> 00:06:33,769
She's having lunch in her room.

95
00:06:37,079 --> 00:06:39,684
-His. -Her.

96
00:06:42,839 --> 00:06:46,161
-Her knife. -His knife.

97
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:51,010
-His fork. -Her fork.

98
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:54,691
-Her glass. -His glass.

99
00:06:56,759 --> 00:07:00,001
-His plate. -Her plate.

100
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:04,327
-Her bowl. -His bowl.

101
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:12,322
-His crown. -Her crown.

102
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:15,369
A headache!

103
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:32,399
Hello, Sylvia. How are you now?

104
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:35,041
How am I now?

105
00:07:35,439 --> 00:07:37,088
I'm fine, thank you.

106
00:07:38,079 --> 00:07:40,047
Where are you going?

107
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:42,967
I'm going to the swimming pool.

108
00:07:43,319 --> 00:07:44,730
See you!

109
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:47,560
Have a nice swim, dear.

110
00:07:50,199 --> 00:07:52,200
Hello, Sylvia.

111
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:54,323
How are you now?

112
00:07:54,839 --> 00:07:58,560
-Feeling better? -Feeling better?

113
00:07:59,319 --> 00:08:00,809
I'm fine.

114
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:02,649
Good, good, good.

115
00:08:02,959 --> 00:08:04,723
Where are you going?

116
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:07,527
I'm going to the tennis court

117
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:10,882
-See you! -Have a nice game, dear.

118
00:08:14,319 --> 00:08:16,640
Sylvia's feeling better now.

119
00:08:16,959 --> 00:08:18,848
She's playing tennis.

120
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:20,883
Playing tennis?

121
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:23,089
No, she isn't.

122
00:08:23,279 --> 00:08:25,327
She's having a swim.

123
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:27,964
Hello, Mummy!

124
00:08:28,519 --> 00:08:30,283
Hello, Daddy!

125
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:32,646
Bye!

